sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser
    participant Web as Django · enforcement
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Policy as FastAPI · decision
    participant Files as Private PDF volume
    Browser->>Web: GET a protected PDF · authenticated session
    Web->>DB: Load material, course and current user's enrollment
    DB-->>Web: Trusted organization, owner, state and membership
    Web->>Policy: POST /authorize · material_read · X-API-Key
    Note over Web,Policy: Subject and context come from Django, not browser claims
    alt Policy replies with allow
        Policy-->>Web: allowed=true · reason · matched_rules · version
        Web->>DB: AuditEvent ACCESS · allowed=true
        Web->>Files: Open the private file
        Files-->>Web: PDF stream, if the file exists
        Web-->>Browser: 200 PDF · private, no-store
    else Policy replies with deny
        Policy-->>Web: allowed=false · reason · version
        Web->>DB: AuditEvent ACCESS · allowed=false
        Web-->>Browser: 403 same organization / 404 different organization
    else Policy timeout, HTTP error or malformed decision
        Note over Web,Policy: No valid allow decision is available
        Web->>DB: AuditEvent ACCESS · POLICY_UNAVAILABLE
        Web-->>Browser: 503 temporary unavailability · no PDF opened
    end
